      "message": "Consider using var name \"TOX\" instead of PYTHON_TOX, and moving the \"tox\" command to the end of the current PYTHON_TOX var def line like:\n\n`...:${VOLTHA_TOOLS_VERSION}-python-lint tox`\n\nThus making this line more readable (and more similar to other uses of containerized tools) as simply:\n\n${TOX} --result-json ...\n\nAlso, separately: Since the container\u0027s WORKDIR is already set to /app, we can assume that the current directory in the container \u003d\u003d this current directory.\nThus can use `./sca-report/sca-report.json` instead of `/app/sca-report/sca-report.json`, which is more in line with other usages, and hopefully more readable.",
